      "text": "[7:43PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow is observed on major routes, including UBA Roundabout to NNPC Filling Station, Cathedral Church to Nitel Intersection, State House to McWen Bridge, and Zone 2 Underbridge to Flagstaff House.\n\nOther areas like Broad Street, Igbosere Road, and Odunlami Street are also moving well.\n\nApongbon is experiencing slow but steady movement due to commercial activities. With personnel strategically positioned, there's currently no reported impediment, ensuring effective traffic management.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
