      "text": "[8:54PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Carter Bridge inw Idumota, Tinubu Square to Tom Jones Intersection.\nOyebanji Roundabout, Ilubinrin to Ijora Olopa, and Carter Bridge to Ebute Ero are all moving well. \nWith traffic officers actively managing the situation, the roads are clear, and commuters are experiencing minimal delays. \nOverall, traffic movement in the area is efficient and well-coordinated.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
